	(logical) vs on-disk footprint invariant.

2026-09-06  David Walther  <david@clearbrookdistillery.com>

	* v7fs.c, v7fs.h: fold the V6 and 2.11BSD backends into the V7 engine
	(v6fs.c and bsd211fs.c deleted).  V6's s_isize-as-block-count, 32-byte
